    <h1>Advanced Heart Failure Treatment in China</h1>
    <p>If your ejection fraction is 35% or lower and medication alone is no longer enough, China's national cardiovascular centers offer the complete pathway — CRT/ICD device therapy, coronary and valve correction, LVAD and heart transplant — with a multidisciplinary review and scheduling typically within 2–4 weeks.</p>
